                                "sense_id": "39993bac-8843-34a2-8849-e1fcef9ea313",
                                "text": "But on some real choice property the matter of any ownership at all was so valuable that bidders bid one-millionth, one-billionth, one-trillionth, etc., even up to one-vigintillionth! ...some courts held that one-vigintillionth was a legally recognizable incumbrance."
                            }
                        ]
